                                "sense_id": "c65d0ecb-0ebb-3516-b78d-3b6311911cec",
                                "text": "As might be expected, the small white loaf was bought mainly by the smaller wholly adult households, who also purchased much more wholemeal, other brown and \"other\" bread than did any type of family with children."
